From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: filipi87 <filipi87@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:37:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] devices-manager-devicechange: audio output routing and
 devicechange events

Replaces upstream enumerateDevices (Android: bypassed, iOS: commented out) with
the Daily devices manager, which also lists audio outputs. Adds setAudioDevice,
getAudioDevice, startMediaDevicesEventMonitor and the mediaDevicesOnDeviceChange
event wired to mediaDevices 'devicechange'/ondevicechange. Includes the iOS
DailyAudioMode state category, which the devices manager depends on.
